  },
  {
   "children": [
    "A working paper written on 2026-10-17, published nearly as written. Local file paths, private repository names and personal names have been removed."
   ],
   "tag": "blockquote"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    "Owner issue: NA-24.  This is a local build only. Nothing is published or deployed: HARD-RULES rule 3 holds until G6. Tiles, prep files and pulls live in git-ignored local data (not published). This file records statistics, commands and budgets only. It contains no data values beyond class names."
   ],
   "tag": "p"
  },
