  {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      "Notes on the pulls:"
     ],
     "tag": "strong"
    }
   ],
   "tag": "p"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "NEP Development Control Area:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " LIO does not publish it. None of LIO_Open01–10 has the layer, and Ontario GeoHub links only the Source Protection atlas viewer. The NEC's own copy is a feature collection embedded in a web map, not a service. The City republishes it as ",
      {
       "children": [
        "PolicyPlanning/MapServer/10"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      " (\"NEC NEP Development Control\", 13 parts province-wide, fields OBJECTID | PART | AREA_HA), and that is the source used here. One part intersects Hamilton."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Secondary Plan Land Use:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      "6 of the 47,212 rows have null geometry, so the envelope query does not return them."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "ID"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      " is null on every row, so the row key is ",
      {
       "children": [
        "OBJECTID"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      ". The class field is ",
      {
       "children": [
        "LANDUSE_CLASS"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      " and the plan field is ",
      {
       "children": [
        "SEC_PLAN_NAME"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      "."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      "4 plan names start with ",
      {
       "children": [
        "Retired - "
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      ": Greensville, Downtown Hamilton, Clappisons Corner and Lower Spencer Creek."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "HCA Regulated Areas:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " ",
      {
       "children": [
        "Version"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      " is 0 on all 134 rows, and there is no class field."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Employment Lands:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " ",
      {
       "children": [
        "CATEGORY"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      " values carry a leading space on 14 of 22 rows (for example ",
      {
       "children": [
        " Business Park"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      " and ",
      {
       "children": [
        "Business Park"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      },
      " both occur)."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "NPCA regulation lands:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " 205 of 271 rows are invalid as served (fixed with make_valid). The 26917 copy is 48.5 MB for 271 rows, because the vertices are very dense."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Urban and Rural Boundary:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " the two areas sum to 1,148.8 km², the City area."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    }
