      },
      " — Features in: 1,246 (9 + 604 + 633) · Zooms: z6–13 · Size: 0.72 MB · Tiles: 195 · Build wall / peak RSS: 10 s / 187 MB"
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "**Total"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      {
       "children": [
        " — Size: "
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      "63.8 MB**"
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    }
   ],
   "tag": "ul"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    "All files are well under the 100 MB per-file target, the total is well under 300 MB, and the nature frame is far under its 3 MB startup budget. Prep took 5–14 s per layer, with a peak of 749 MB (buildings)."
   ],
   "tag": "p"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      "Completeness at maximum zoom"
     ],
     "tag": "strong"
    },
    " (counted by decoding with tippecanoe-decode):"
   ],
   "tag": "p"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Parcels:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      "166,743 of 166,745 HeavyMap IDs at z15."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      "The 2 missing are sub-square-metre slivers that vanish at tile precision."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      "At z12 the densest tiles keep only the sparsest features, so 55,664 IDs appear; z14 has 166,742."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Buildings:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " 214,278 of 214,287 at z15, and 135,804 at z13."
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    }
   ],
   "tag": "ul"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    "Overzooming past z15 is left to the client."
   ],
   "tag": "p"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      "Commands"
     ],
     "tag": "strong"
    },
    " (from ",
    {
     "children": [
      "build_tiles_hamilton.sh"
     ],
     "tag": "code"
    },
    "):"
   ],
   "tag": "p"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "Common flags:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " ",
      {
       "children": [
        "TIPPECANOE_MAX_THREADS=2 tippecanoe --force --read-parallel --temporary-directory=<tiles>a local working copy --no-progress-indicator"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "parcels:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " ",
      {
       "children": [
        "-l parcels -Z12 -z15 --detect-shared-borders --simplification=2 --no-tiny-polygon-reduction --drop-densest-as-needed --extend-zooms-if-still-dropping"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "buildings:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " ",
      {
       "children": [
        "-l buildings -Z13 -z15 --simplification=2 --drop-densest-as-needed --extend-zooms-if-still-dropping"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "zoning:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " ",
      {
       "children": [
        "-l zoning -Z10 -z15 --detect-shared-borders --simplification=4 --coalesce-densest-as-needed --extend-zooms-if-still-dropping"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    },
    {
     "children": [
      {
       "children": [
        "nature-frame:"
       ],
       "tag": "strong"
      },
      " ",
      {
       "children": [
        "-Z6 -z13 --simplification=10 --detect-shared-borders --coalesce-smallest-as-needed --maximum-tile-bytes=300000 -L greenbelt:… -L conservation:… -L parks:…"
       ],
       "tag": "code"
      }
     ],
     "tag": "li"
    }
   ],
   "tag": "ul"
  },
  {
   "children": [
    {
     "children": [
      "Memory:"
     ],
     "tag": "strong"
    },
    " deb had about 2.3 GB free (about 5.4 GB available) during the build. The two-thread cap and temp files on ",
    {
     "children": [
      "/fast"
     ],
     "tag": "code"
    },
